---
import { videoPage } from '@/data/video'
---

<section class="video-section video-join" aria-labelledby="join-title">
    <div class="video-section__content">
        <div class="join-panel">
            <div class="join-panel__back">
                <h2 id="join-title">{videoPage.join.title}</h2>
                <p class="join-panel__lead">练啥不如练技术，学啥不如学技能。<br />同学，技多不压身哦！</p>
                <p class="join-panel__context">视频化时代，掌握视频剪辑技能不仅能增强就业竞争力，更能利用剪辑副业多一份外快收入。</p>
                <div class="join-panel__front">
                    {videoPage.join.paragraphs.map((paragraph) => <p>{paragraph}</p>)}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
